      "uid": "zhcn:7f52e10c56803291785a7856",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一起训练了一阵子后，\n就如同奇锐骏本人所言，她的体力增长了不少。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c408846cbcc82cfc701a93de96871100146c9e171224ed2bc30a512a10297601",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
