      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我朝呼唤我的方向走去，奇锐骏和她的同伴──\n北港火山和小林历奇正聚在那里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eac1fda4d9bcaf8ab4bb7df78ddcbb761d8b8f0c682d20674e97b2972262ea28",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
