      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a24039828ddf94c53d4ec392",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唔哇，所以奇锐骏是真的跟训练员签约啦！？\n居然能遇到相生的对象，真是非常lucky又happy呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e7da6f87c477ecbe39050b719a121739409c0b483bdb3416bbc249150678c71",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
