      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不是的，我们并没有正式签约喔～\n是我请他在多项目竞技大赛前帮我做准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06cff2091249aa58d7a6feba40c15ebbc2e9b05a8492b7fd18c17bfd8ae5a7c6",
